Hardware Requirements:
• Processor: Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 5 or higher
• Memory: Minimum 8 GB / 16 GB DDR4 RAM
• Storage: 256 GB SSD (for fast model weights loading)
• Camera: Integrated Laptop Webcam or external USB HD CameraSoftware Requirements:
• Operating System: Windows 10/11 or Ubuntu Linux
